ve to have fun if you don't have fun  with the person you're with and all  you're doing is dealing with issues then  then that gets pretty old and so you  have to protect the fun element of your  life together and the way to do that  isn't by hanging around the house and  and dealing with you know sort of more  problems you have to get away and and  reinforce and reinvigorate your  relationship and whenever I tell one of  our younger people about that they sort  of look at me in there it's like the  scales are falling off of their eyes and  they're saying geez you know I hadn't  thought about that you know I'm so  enmeshed in all these things but that's  a great idea  and that's something is  entrepreneur you also have to do you  just can't let relationships slip  because you're half overwhelmed  you
 

